  "summary": "Skip the hotel and book your own private wing in the Historic District. This 2-bedroom suite offers the ultimate Basecamp experience prioritizing premium sleeping quarters and a fully equipped kitchen for groups who spend their days exploring.\n\nLocated steps from Hayward Field, it is designed for colleagues, couples, or small families who need a comfortable launchpad with real bedrooms and a dedicated dining hub.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "title": "The space",
      "text": "Two spacious bedrooms, each with a Queen bed, offer equal comfort for all guests. The heart of the unit is the full kitchen and dining table perfect for team breakfasts or late-night planning sessions. Please note, this unit prioritizes bedroom size and kitchen utility. There is no traditional living room with a sofa, making it ideal for active groups who are out and about. Fast Wi-Fi and dedicated workspace make it easy to stay connected."
    },
    {
      "title": "Guest access",
      "text": "This place shares a yard with another one of our Airbnb rentals. The yard is divided by a fence and our other rental allows dogs as well so just be mindful.\n\n* occasionally, our cleaners will need to use the basement laundry. Be aware between 11am - 3pm, we may briefly walk through the shared basement area to access the laundry."
    },
    {
      "title": "Other things to note",
      "text": "* Parking space is suitable for two small cars back to back or one truck. Not appropriate for 2 large vehicles :("
    }
